      "body": "optimized_CO2_host_interaction_and_faster_CO2_diffusion → selectivity"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "extremely_slow_N2_diffusion → diffusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] make slight adjustments to pore size/shape and local pore chemistry in ultramicropores without specific binding sites → can significantly change adsorption affinity and thereby alter multicomponent separation behavior"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] design the adsorbent so that C2H4 has the lowest adsorption affinity among the four gases → enables one-step C2H4 purification from CO2/C2H2/C2H4/C2H6"
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparison",
      "body": "Zn-fa-atz (2) vs Zn-fa-datz (1): winner=subject_a on CO2_vs_C2H4_adsorption_preference"
    }
